/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Long\040Short\055Term\040Memory\040Based\040Recurrent\040Neural\040Network\040Architectures\040for\040Large\040Vocabulary\040Speech\040Recognition)
/Author (Hasim\040Sak\054\040Andrew\040W\056\040Senior\054\040Francoise\040Beaufays)
/Subject (Long\040Short\055Term\040Memory\040\050LSTM\051\040is\040a\040recurrent\040neural\040network\040\050RNN\051\040architecture\040that\040has\040been\040designed\040to\040address\040the\040vanishing\040and\040exploding\040gradient\040problems\040of\040conventional\040RNNs\056\040Unlike\040feedforward\040neural\040networks\054\040RNNs\040have\040cyclic\040connections\040making\040them\040powerful\040for\040modeling\040sequences\056\040They\040have\040been\040successfully\040used\040for\040sequence\040labeling\040and\040sequence\040prediction\040tasks\054\040such\040as\040handwriting\040recognition\054\040language\040modeling\054\040phonetic\040labeling\040of\040acoustic\040frames\056\040However\054\040in\040contrast\040to\040the\040deep\040neural\040networks\054\040the\040use\040of\040RNNs\040in\040speech\040recognition\040has\040been\040limited\040to\040phone\040recognition\040in\040small\040scale\040tasks\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040present\040novel\040LSTM\040based\040RNN\040architectures\040which\040make\040more\040effective\040use\040of\040model\040parameters\040to\040train\040acoustic\040models\040for\040large\040vocabulary\040speech\040recognition\056\040We\040train\040and\040compare\040LSTM\054\040RNN\040and\040DNN\040models\040at\040various\040numbers\040of\040parameters\040and\040configurations\056\040We\040show\040that\040LSTM\040models\040converge\040quickly\040and\040give\040state\040of\040the\040art\040speech\040recognition\040performance\040for\040relatively\040small\040sized\040models\056)
/Keywords (05\040Feb\0402014\054\040arXiv\072\040Neural\040and\040Evolutionary\040Computing\054\040Recurrent\040neural\040network\054\040Sequence\040labeling\054\040Language\040model\054\040Feedforward\040neural\040network\054\040Handwriting\040recognition)
>>
